# Secrets / config
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Scraped corpus — regenerable via scripts/scrape_ask_uwindsor.py, large, drifts from source
data/ask_uwindsor/
data/**/raw/
# NOT `*.jsonl`. That blanket rule was here, was redundant with the two paths above, and
# silently excluded backend/evals/golden/uwindsor.jsonl — the golden set the entire eval
# harness reads. The code shipped, the data did not: CI could never have run the evals, a
# clone could not reproduce a single published number, and the Docker build failed on
# `COPY evals` with a message about a missing directory rather than a missing file.
# Ignore data by PATH, never by extension.

# Python (uv)
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Node / Next.js
node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
.turbo/

# Vector store artifacts (if any local)
chroma/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/

